  textsArray:
  - During your Play sometimes you'll found a mysterious sphere...
  - "This sphere has a meteor-like form but it is not a Meteor.\n\\n\nSome Peopole
    say that after deflecting one of them, if you press both sides of your phone
    at the same time..\n\\n \nA Super Effect Will Happen..."
  - Try to Deflect one of them and see what has inside!
  lastPageNextButtonText: Try!
